   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:a1"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:104",
   "ptr": "0x104",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "「今こそォー！\\n",
   "en": "\"The time is nooow! We, the working claaass, shall riiise! Light the beacon of revolutiooon! And build an ideal nation for all the peoooople!\"",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:117",
   "ptr": "0x117",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　我々、労働者階級が立ち上がりィー！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:104"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:140",
   "ptr": "0x140",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　革命の狼煙を上げェー！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:104"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:15d",
   "ptr": "0x15d",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　万民の理想国家を建設しィー！」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　革命の狼煙を上げェー！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:104"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:188",
   "ptr": "0x188",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「おれっちは学がねえから、何言ってん\\n",
   "en": "\"Me, I ain't got no schoolin', so I can't make heads or tails of what he's sayin'.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:1b1",
   "ptr": "0x1b1",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  のか、さっぱりわかんねえや」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:188"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:1da",
   "ptr": "0x1da",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「へっ、いくら新しい国を造ったって、\\n",
   "en": "\"Heh, build all the new countries ya want. Once the Black Dragon wakes up, it's all over, ain't it?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:203",
   "ptr": "0x203",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  《黒竜》が目を覚ましゃ、お終いじゃ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:1da"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:22c",
   "ptr": "0x22c",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  ねーか」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:1da"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:241",
   "ptr": "0x241",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「・・・ああそうだよ、おりゃァ泥棒さ。\\n",
   "en": "\"...Yeah, that's right, I'm a thief. So what's it to ya, huh? The way things are, whoever steals wins. Nobody knows when they're gonna die, see.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:26c",
   "ptr": "0x26c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　だから何だってんだよ？　え？　こう\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:241"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:295",
   "ptr": "0x295",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  なりゃ盗っちまった方の勝ちさ、いつ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:241"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:2be",
   "ptr": "0x2be",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  死ぬかわかんねえんだからよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:241"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:2e7",
   "ptr": "0x2e7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ここから下まで乗せてってあげるわ。\\n",
   "en": "\"I'll give you a ride from here down to the bottom.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:310",
   "ptr": "0x310",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　１回、１００Ｇでいかが？」",
   "en": "How about 100G a trip?\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:368",
   "ptr": "0x368",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「あら？　お金が足りないようね」\\f",
   "en": "\"Oh? Looks like you're short on money.\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:397",
   "ptr": "0x397",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "「ありがとう。じゃあ、乗って」\\f",
   "en": "\"Thank you. Hop on, then.\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:3c7",
   "ptr": "0x3c7",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「早く街の外へ出たい時は声をかけてね」\\f",
   "en": "\"Call me whenever you want to get out of town fast.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:405",
   "ptr": "0x405",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「自慢じゃないが、このおれは辺境では\\n",
   "en": "\"Not to brag, but back in the Frontier, I was known as a bit of a know-it-all.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:42e",
   "ptr": "0x42e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ちょっとした物知りで通ってたんだ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:405"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:457",
   "ptr": "0x457",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　どうだ？　おれと賭けをしねえか？」",
   "en": "So how about it? Wanna make a bet with me?\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:488",
   "ptr": "0x488",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「よ～し、じゃあ、おれの出す問題に答\\n",
   "en": "\"Alrighty, answer my question. Get it right, and I'll give ya somethin' ya don't see every day.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:4b1",
   "ptr": "0x4b1",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  えてみろ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:488"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:4c2",
   "ptr": "0x4c2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  答えられたら、めったにお目にかかれ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  えてみろ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:488"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:4eb",
   "ptr": "0x4eb",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  ない物をくれてやる。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:488"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:507",
   "ptr": "0x507",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ただし、答えられなかったら、持ち金\\n",
   "en": "But if ya can't answer, I'm takin' half your money, got it?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:530",
   "ptr": "0x530",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  の半分をいただくぜ？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:507"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:54c",
   "ptr": "0x54c",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　おっと！\\n",
   "en": "Whoa there! No backing out now. If you're a man, take the challenge like one.",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:55b",
   "ptr": "0x55b",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　いまさら、やめるってのは無しだ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　おっと！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:54c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:582",
   "ptr": "0x582",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　男なら、いさぎよく勝負しろよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:54c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:5a8",
   "ptr": "0x5a8",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　いいな？\\n",
   "en": "Got it? Then here's the question...",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:5b7",
   "ptr": "0x5b7",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　じゃあ、問題を出すぜ・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　いいな？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:5a8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:5d9",
   "ptr": "0x5d9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　《貴族の塔》の８階に、落とし穴の数\\n",
   "en": "On the 8th floor of the Nobles' Tower, how many pitfalls",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:602",
   "ptr": "0x602",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  は全部でいくつある？」",
   "en": "are there in all?\"",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:62a",
   "ptr": "0x62a",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「あんた、よく知ってるね～！\\n",
   "en": "\"Hey, you sure know your stuff! I lose. Here, take this.\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:64b",
   "ptr": "0x64b",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　負けたよ、こいつを持ってきな」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:62a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:679",
   "ptr": "0x679",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "《至福の鈴》を手に入れた。\\f",
   "en": "Obtained the Bell of Bliss.",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:699",
   "ptr": "0x699",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「こいつの使い方は、おれにもわかんね\\n",
   "en": "\"Even I dunno how to use that thing.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:6c2",
   "ptr": "0x6c2",
   "len": 12,
