   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:8d6",
   "ptr": "0x8d6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「我々はこの国の将来を憂慮する者の集\\n",
   "en": "\"We are a group of those concerned for this country's future. Though the nobles have fled, the present situation could easily give rise to a new rule by violence.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:8ff",
   "ptr": "0x8ff",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  まりです。貴族たちが逃亡したとはい\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:8d6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:928",
   "ptr": "0x928",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  え、今の状況は、容易に新たな暴力に\\n",
