   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:8d6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:977",
   "ptr": "0x977",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　市民を守ってくれる国、そして、市民\\n",
   "en": "What's needed most now is a country that protects its citizens, and heroes who fight for those citizens.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:9a0",
   "ptr": "0x9a0",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  のために戦ってくれる勇者こそが、今、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:977"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:9cb",
   "ptr": "0x9cb",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  最も求められてるのです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07O:977"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07O:9eb",
   "ptr": "0x9eb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　自らの地位に固執する騎士、金のため\\n",
